  triage:title "The adrs list (lines 42-56) omits ADR-SAG-0029 (Active)" ;
  triage:description "The adrs list (lines 42-56) omits ADR-SAG-0029 (Active). Its (c) row (docs/architecture.md:1095) governs every serde_json encode/decode failure: INPUT_INVALID with category and line/column only. The delta this sprint owns (decode_failed in payload.rs:104 and its call sites at payload.rs:428 and jev/v1.rs:565) implements that row, and the sprint's own deliverable 9 cites it in substance. The omission is a RULE-ADR-PLAN miss." ;
